module
public import CFSG.Quasithin.Chapter5.Section03UnitaryNativeLift.Actions

/-!
# Exact native unitary amalgam lifting

Automorphisms of the native U₄(2ᵐ) pair (m > 1) and U₅(4) pair extend uniquely
with the prescribed endpoint maps. Flag restriction is bijective in both
orientations and every action lifts uniquely and coherently. The proof uses
the pure inner comparison and paired quadrangle covers, not recognition of
a source join. Source: Aschbacher–Smith 5.3.2 and F.4.8–10,16–17.
-/
